{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Deshe.</b> Kinds of herbage for animal food, as it says (Joel 2:22): כִּי דָשְׁאוּ נְאוֹת מִדְבָּר." "<b>Herb yielding seed.</b> For human food." "<b>Fruit tree bearing fruit after its kind.</b> For what is compounded from two species does not reproduce." "<b>And it was so.</b> It was so established, without receiving any deficiency or excess, so that if a plant compounded from two species should occur, it would not reproduce."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:46.831299412Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}